sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Cluster Admin
    participant CLI as rhaii-validator CLI<br/>Controller Mode
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS1.2+
    participant NodeJob as Check Job Pod<br/>Privileged Container
    participant Host as Host sysfs<br/>nvidia-smi / rocm-smi
    participant ServerJob as Server Job Pod<br/>validator-tools
    participant ClientJob as Client Job Pod<br/>validator-tools
    participant CM as ConfigMap

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
    Note over Admin,CM: Flow 1: GPU Hardware Validation
    Admin->>CLI: kubectl rhaii-validate check
    CLI->>K8s: Create RBAC, Namespace<br/>Bearer Token
    CLI->>K8s: Create per-node Check Job<br/>Bearer Token
    K8s->>NodeJob: Schedule on GPU node
    NodeJob->>Host: chroot /host<br/>nvidia-smi / rocm-smi<br/>Privileged container
    Host-->>NodeJob: GPU driver version, ECC errors,<br/>PCI topology
    NodeJob->>NodeJob: Write JSON to stdout,<br/>progress to stderr
    CLI->>K8s: Read pod logs<br/>Bearer Token
    K8s-->>CLI: Structured JSON results
    CLI->>K8s: Create/Update ConfigMap<br/>Bearer Token
    K8s->>CM: Store JSON report
    CLI-->>Admin: Table / JSON output
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
    Note over Admin,CM: Flow 2: RDMA Bandwidth Test (Ring Topology)
    Admin->>CLI: kubectl rhaii-validate bandwidth --rdma
    CLI->>K8s: Create Server Job on Node A<br/>Bearer Token
    K8s->>ServerJob: Schedule on Node A
    ServerJob->>ServerJob: ib_write_bw --listen<br/>Port 18515+/TCP
    Note over CLI,ServerJob: Wait for pod IP + 3s startup delay
    CLI->>K8s: Create Client Job on Node B<br/>Bearer Token
    K8s->>ClientJob: Schedule on Node B
    ClientJob->>ServerJob: ib_write_bw connect<br/>18515+/TCP RDMA<br/>GPUDirect RDMA
    ServerJob-->>ClientJob: RDMA bandwidth result
    ClientJob->>ClientJob: Write JSON to stdout
    CLI->>K8s: Read client pod logs<br/>Bearer Token
    K8s-->>CLI: Bandwidth measurements
    CLI->>K8s: Update ConfigMap<br/>Bearer Token
    K8s->>CM: Append to report
    CLI-->>Admin: Bandwidth results
    end
